## Title: Satchel Exchange
## Author: neaucode
## Version: 0.5.0
## APIVersion: 101050
## Description: Press Talk, get a satchel: auto-opens the store from dialogue, buys one, and exits, re-arming across visits (e.g. Dremora Vendor Tur's jewelry dust satchels).
